        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wyanet%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Wyanet sits at the crossroads of Routes 6 and 34 in north‑central Illinois, a spot that has kept the village connected for generations.",
